@page "/nicht-gefunden"
@model RenoTrack.Website.Pages.NichtGefundenModel
@using RenoTrack.Website.Site
@{
    Layout = SiteLayout.Path;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Seite nicht gefunden";
    ViewData.SetNoIndex();
}
@*
    The marketing site's 404 (D103). Reached by re-executing a bodyless GET/HEAD 404, or directly. Either way
    it answers 404 and is not indexed.

    It never names the address that was requested: echoing a path or query back would reflect whatever a
    visitor or a crafted link put there, including something that looks like a customer's token.
*@
<h1 class="site-page-title">Seite nicht gefunden</h1>

<p class="site-lead">
    Die aufgerufene Seite gibt es nicht oder nicht mehr. Bitte prüfen Sie die Adresse.
</p>
